  "prefLabel": "Fis 1002.03 Applicant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1002.03 “Applicant” means any person or legal entity who seeks a permit, approval, or other written authorization from a state agency as a prerequisite to conducting a proposed action.\n\nSource. #13313, eff 2-3-22",
